flowchart TD
  A[Idea] --> G1{Demo in 3 min?}
  G1 -- no --> N[NO-GO + replacement]
  G1 -- yes --> G2{Feasible in 60% of time?}
  G2 -- no --> N
  G2 -- yes --> G3{New part vs prior art?}
  G3 -- no --> P[PIVOT: add wedge]
  G3 -- yes --> G4{Free tier survives demo day?}
  G4 -- no --> P
  G4 -- yes --> G5{Rules and terms OK?}
  G5 -- no --> N
  G5 -- yes --> S[Score >= 75?]
  S -- yes --> GO[GO]
  S -- no --> P
